# Intentionally empty.
#
# This repository contains randomly generated tokens used as test fixtures, to prove the
# secret guards actually fire. They must stay detectable by gitleaks - that is the point
# of the test - so they cannot simply be weakened until the scanner stops caring.
#
# They are suppressed with an inline `# gitleaks:allow` comment on the offending line
# rather than by fingerprint here. A fingerprint embeds the line number, so any edit
# above the fixture shifts it, silently invalidates the entry, and turns CI red for a
# reason unrelated to the change. The inline marker travels with the line.
#
# If you ever do add an entry here, never add a real finding. Rotate the credential.
